  "scale": "1/144",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士Z ガンダム』主要MS立体化のラストを飾るシリーズ最大級の「サイコ・ガンダム Mk-II」がHGで立体化!!",
      "en": "\"Psycho Gundam Mk-II \", the largest in the series that marks the last of the major MS three-dimensional versions of \" Mobile Suit Z Gundam\", is now three-dimensional in HG!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 全高約270mm。迫力のサイズ感。",
      "en": "• Overall height approximately 270mm. Impressive size."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• モビル・フォートレス状態への変形が可能。",
      "en": "• Can transform into Mobile Fortress state."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 細かな色分けはパーツ分割により再現。",
      "en": "• Detailed color coding is reproduced by dividing the parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「アクションベース4」と「ウェポンディスプレイベース」が付属。劇中をイメージしたディスプレイができる。",
      "en": "• \"Action Base 4 \" and \" Weapon Display Base\" are included. You can create a display inspired by the movie."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 劇中シーンをイメージした半壊状態の頭部パーツも付属。",
      "en": "• A half-destructed head part inspired by the scene in the movie is also included."
    }
  ],
